'=================================================================================
' TRANSFORMATION RULES SUMMARY - FINAL VERSION
'=================================================================================
'
' OUTPUT COLUMN HEADERS:
' Column 1: Top C
' Column 2: Middle C
' Column 3: Middle C
' Column 4: Middle C
' Column 5: Lowest C
' Column 6: N element (NEW)
'
' TRANSFORMATION LOGIC:
'
' FILTERING RULES (ALL MUST BE TRUE TO PROCESS):
' 1. Comments column must contain "new" (case-insensitive, wildcard)
' 2. Level1 Name must be "Alpha" OR "Kenamma" OR "Naago"
' 3. Level5 Name must NOT contain "Retained", "Retd", or "Rtd"
'
' FOR EACH INPUT ROW THAT PASSES FILTERS, GENERATE 3 OUTPUT ROWS:
'
' Row 1:
'   Column 1 (Top C): "RBMI - [Level 2 Name] (L2)"
'   Column 2 (Middle C): "RBMI - GIA_ALL" if STD/STEWARDSHIP, else "RBMI - GIA_ATT"
'   Column 3 (Middle C): "GIA_NCRALL" if STD/STEWARDSHIP, else "GIA_NCRATT"
'   Column 4 (Middle C): "."
'   Column 5 (Lowest C): "RBMI - [Level5 ID]_NCR"
'   Column 6 (N element): "R-[Level5 ID]"
'
' Row 2:
'   Column 1 (Top C): "RBMI - [Level 2 Name] (L2)"
'   Column 2 (Middle C): "RBMI - GIA_ALL" if STD/STEWARDSHIP, else "RBMI - GIA_ATT"
'   Column 3 (Middle C): "GIA_RACALL" if STD/STEWARDSHIP, else "GIA_RACATT"
'   Column 4 (Middle C): "GIA_ARACALL" if STD/STEWARDSHIP, else "GIA_ARACATT"
'   Column 5 (Lowest C): "RBMI - [Level5 ID]_ARAC"
'   Column 6 (N element): "I-Dummy"
'
' Row 3:
'   Column 1 (Top C): "RBMI - [Level 2 Name] (L2)"
'   Column 2 (Middle C): "RBMI - GIA_ALL" if STD/STEWARDSHIP, else "RBMI - GIA_ATT"
'   Column 3 (Middle C): "GIA_RACALL" if STD/STEWARDSHIP, else "GIA_RACATT"
'   Column 4 (Middle C): "GIA_SRACALL" if STD/STEWARDSHIP, else "GIA_SRACATT"
'   Column 5 (Lowest C): "RBMI - [Level5 ID]_SRAC"
'   Column 6 (N element): "I-Dummy"
'
' STD/STEWARDSHIP DETECTION:
' - Checks Level 5 Name (Column B) for "(STD)" or "(STEWARDSHIP)"
' - Case-insensitive search
' - If found: Uses "ALL" suffix
' - If not found: Uses "ATT" suffix
'
' FILTER EXAMPLES:
' ✓ PASS: Comments="New", Level1Name="Alpha", Level5Name="Product (std)"
' ✓ PASS: Comments="all New", Level1Name="Kenamma", Level5Name="Product"
' ✓ PASS: Comments="New_11", Level1Name="Naago", Level5Name="Product (Stewardship)"
' ✗ FAIL: Comments="old", Level1Name="Alpha", Level5Name="Product" (no "new")
' ✗ FAIL: Comments="New", Level1Name="Beta", Level5Name="Product" (wrong Level1)
' ✗ FAIL: Comments="New", Level1Name="Alpha", Level5Name="Product (Retained)" (excluded)
'
'=================================================================================